1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:27,140
Welcome to the detailed Financial Suite guide. In Invoices, top KPI cards track sales and VAT, tabs separate Tax, Proforma, and Notes, and instant filters sort by Paid, Partial, or Unpaid status.

2
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:54,410
Inside invoice details, view exact totals, collected amounts, remaining halalas, and the collection progress bar. Record cash or bank payments directly, issue credit or debit notes, and download the ZATCA QR PDF.

3
00:00:54,700 --> 00:01:17,660
The 4-stage wizard starts in Stage 1 by choosing the tax document type and linking an existing contract to auto-fill client and VAT details, then Stage 2 verifies route, vehicle, and supply date.

4
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:43,870
In Stage 3, enter service price as Before or Includes 15% VAT, pick the tax category, and watch the sticky side summary compute net, VAT, and grand total live; Stage 4 sets payment terms and automatic WhatsApp delivery.

5
00:01:44,167 --> 00:02:08,327
In Purchases and Fleet Expenses, record vendor bills for fuel, maintenance, and insurance linked directly to each bus. Toggle Includes 15% VAT for exact reverse halala extraction, alongside non-taxable expenses and purchase returns.

6
00:02:08,617 --> 00:02:32,777
In the Accounting Hub, the Profits & Expenses tab displays the Income Statement, net profit before and after zakat, and live cash, bank, AR, and AP cards—plus an expandable Trial Balance and per-vehicle profitability table.

7
00:02:33,067 --> 00:02:57,147
Across the remaining Accounting tabs, manage balanced Journal Entries, inspect any Account Ledger, issue Receipt and Payment Vouchers with smart invoice lookup, and lock audited periods against retroactive changes.

8
00:02:57,450 --> 00:03:19,610
The hierarchical Chart of Accounts separates group headers from posting accounts; in VAT Returns, select included invoices and copy reconciled ZATCA Boxes 1–16 directly into the tax portal.

9
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:48,780
The Unified Financial Exports Center consolidates everything in one page: pick ready audit or ZATCA bundles, filter across 19 advanced criteria, preview 9 live financial datasets, and export a single A4 PDF, Excel CSV, or JSON package.

10
00:03:49,083 --> 00:04:08,843
The financial cycle completes with Company, Bank, and IBAN settings printed on invoices, plus ZATCA Phase 2 cryptographic onboarding and compliance monitoring.
